  "title": "A Novel Phenolic Compound from                     <i>Phyllanthus emblica</i>",
  "abstract": "A new compound, mucic acid 3- O-gallate (1), was isolated from the fruit of Phyllanthus emblica L, together with 5 known compounds (2-6). Their structures were elucidated on the basis of spectroscopic analysis, including 1D and 2D NMR techniques, and by comparison with literature data.",
